Scope

This licence applies to the original work in this repository: the tooling under
tools/ (excluding tools/maspsx, tools/asm-differ and tools/m2c, which are git
submodules carrying their own licences), the configuration under config/, the
headers under include/, linker_scripts/, and the documentation.

It does not apply to the decompiled C source under src/. That code is derived
from Yu-Gi-Oh! Forbidden Memories (SLUS-01411), which is copyright Konami; it
is a work of reverse engineering and carries whatever status the original does.
No licence to it is granted here.

No game code, game data, disc image, or Psy-Q SDK binary is distributed in this
repository.
